    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "I pretty sure that you should keep `void` here and that it is the `Router.dispose` signature in `src/types/instantsearch.ts` that is incorrect.\r\n\r\nI think this is what you wanted:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n export type Router<TRouteState = UiState> = {\r\n   onUpdate(callback: (route: TRouteState) => void): void;\r\n   read(): UiState;\r\n   write(route: TRouteState): void;\r\n   createURL(state: TRouteState): string;\r\n-  dispose(): Widget['dispose'];\r\n+  dispose: Widget['dispose'];\r\n };\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen there is multiple differences between `Router.dispose` and `Widget.dispose`: \r\n\r\n* mandatory on `Router` and optional on `Widget`\r\n* `options` parameter on `Widget` and no parameters on `Router`\r\n\r\nSo the final definition should be more like:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n export type Router<TRouteState = UiState> = {\r\n   onUpdate(callback: (route: TRouteState) => void): void;\r\n   read(): UiState;\r\n   write(route: TRouteState): void;\r\n   createURL(state: TRouteState): string;\r\n-  dispose(): Widget['dispose'];\r\n+  dispose(): SearchParameters | void;\r\n };\r\n```\r\n\r\nWDYT?",
    "commit_id": "611090bff85eb37e8b5f8d99dbc65d2cb3561fa6",
    "created_at": "2019-05-14T10:52:03Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -179,7 +179,7 @@ class BrowserHistory {\n   /**\n    * Removes the event listener and cleans up the URL.\n    */\n-  public dispose(): void {\n+  public dispose(): undefined {",
